# FPGA generated outputs (huge — do not commit).
# Patterns are deliberately NOT anchored to a phase path: the mlp/ + gbdt/
# reorg broke the old anchored versions and made ~10k generated files visible
# at once. Match on the generated directory name instead, wherever it lives.
